              "label": "Description",
              "content": "Cotton textile created in the double ikat or 'geringsing' technique showing a \"kota-mesir\" pattern (four-pointed star, notched internal pattern, divides piece into semi-circular segments). Semi-circles depict \"wayang patlikur isi\" motif (geometric wayang figure) and other figures. Wide border at end with geometric pattern. Design in tan on black. Fringed."
